["<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n1\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">〜をもって</span><span class=\"lvb\">N1</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">凭借……、通过……；也可表示从某时起生效或截止</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">with; by means of; as of (a time)</span></span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">名词 + をもって</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Noun + をもって</span></span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>以上<rp>(</rp><rt>いじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をもちまして、<ruby>本日<rp>(</rp><rt>ほんじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>説明<rp>(</rp><rt>せつめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>会<rp>(</rp><rt>かい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>終了<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いたします。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">到这里，今天的说明会就结束了。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">With that, we conclude today&#x27;s information session.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>選考<rp>(</rp><rt>せんこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>結果<rp>(</rp><rt>けっか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、<ruby>後日<rp>(</rp><rt>ごじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>書面<rp>(</rp><rt>しょめん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をもってお<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らせいたします。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">选拔结果稍后会以书面形式通知您。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">The selection results will be sent to you in writing at a later date.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>圧倒的<rp>(</rp><rt>あっとうてき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>な<ruby>実力<rp>(</rp><rt>じつりょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をもって、<ruby>並<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>み<ruby>居<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る<ruby>強豪<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうごう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>次々<rp>(</rp><rt>つぎつぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>打<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ち<ruby>破<rp>(</rp><rt>やぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">他凭借压倒性的实力，接连战胜了一个又一个强劲对手。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">With his overwhelming ability, he defeated one formidable rival after another.</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"note\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">补充</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">補足</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">可表示手段，如「書面をもって」「実力をもって」，也可正式标出终止时间，如「本日をもって」。「〜をもちまして」常见于通知。「〜をもってすれば」表示凭借该条件就能……。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Two uses: means (書面をもって, 実力をもって) and a formal end point (本日をもって). 〜をもちまして is common in announcements; 〜をもってすれば = &#x27;with ..., (anything is possible)&#x27;.</span></span></p><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"https://github.com/evanclan/OpenJLPT/blob/main/data/json/grammar/n1.json\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看 OpenJLPT 来源</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">OpenJLPT の出典を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>","<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n1\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">〜をものともせず</span><span class=\"lvb\">N1</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">“不顾……”“不把……当回事”。面对困难毫不畏惧地行动。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">困難を問題にしないで、勇敢に行動することを表す。</span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">名词＋をものともせず（に）</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞＋をものともせず（に）</span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はけがをものともせず、<ruby>最後<rp>(</rp><rt>さいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まで<ruby>走<rp>(</rp><rt>はし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>続<rp>(</rp><rt>つづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">他不顾伤痛，一直跑到最后。</span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>周囲<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>反対<rp>(</rp><rt>はんたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をものともせず、<ruby>二人<rp>(</rp><rt>ふたり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>結婚<rp>(</rp><rt>けっこん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">两人不顾周围的反对结了婚。</span></li></ul><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"#g5\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看精选讲解</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">詳しい解説を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>","<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n1\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">〜を余儀なくされる</span><span class=\"lvb\">N1</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">“不得不……”。迫于外部情况，只能那样做。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">周りの事情によって、そうするしかない状況に追い込まれることを表す。</span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">名词＋を余儀なくされる</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞＋を余儀なくされる</span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>台風<rp>(</rp><rt>たいふう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で、<ruby>大会<rp>(</rp><rt>たいかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>中止<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゅうし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>余儀<rp>(</rp><rt>よぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なくされた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">因为台风，大会被迫中止。</span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>工場<rp>(</rp><rt>こうじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>閉鎖<rp>(</rp><rt>へいさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>により、<ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くの<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>転職<rp>(</rp><rt>てんしょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>余儀<rp>(</rp><rt>よぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なくされた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">由于工厂关闭，许多人不得不换工作。</span></li></ul><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"#g1\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看精选讲解</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">詳しい解説を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>","<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n1\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">〜をよそに</span><span class=\"lvb\">N1</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">不顾……、对……置之不理</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">ignoring; paying no heed to; oblivious to</span></span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">名词 + をよそに</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Noun + をよそに</span></span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>親<rp>(</rp><rt>おや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>心配<rp>(</rp><rt>しんぱい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をよそに、<ruby>息子<rp>(</rp><rt>むすこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>連日<rp>(</rp><rt>れんじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>夜<rp>(</rp><rt>よる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>遅<rp>(</rp><rt>おそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くまで<ruby>遊<rp>(</rp><rt>あそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>び<ruby>歩<rp>(</rp><rt>ある</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">儿子不管父母有多担心，每天晚上都在外面待到很晚。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Heedless of his parents&#x27; worry, their son is out until late every night.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>住民<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅうみん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>反対<rp>(</rp><rt>はんたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をよそに、<ruby>高層<rp>(</rp><rt>こうそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>マンションの<ruby>建設<rp>(</rp><rt>けんせつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">尽管居民反对，高层公寓还是开工了。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Construction of the high-rise condominium began despite residents&#x27; opposition.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>世間<rp>(</rp><rt>せけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>騒<rp>(</rp><rt>さわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぎをよそに、<ruby>当<rp>(</rp><rt>とう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>本人<rp>(</rp><rt>ほんにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はのんびりと<ruby>釣<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りを<ruby>楽<rp>(</rp><rt>たの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しんでいた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">外面都闹得沸沸扬扬了，当事人却悠闲地钓着鱼。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Oblivious to all the public fuss, the man at the center of it was leisurely enjoying some fishing.</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"note\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">补充</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">補足</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">前项多是旁人的「心配」「期待」「反対」「批判」等感受或反应，行动者并没有理会。常有轻微批评意味。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">The noun is usually others&#x27; feelings or reactions (心配, 期待, 反対, 批判) that the subject disregards; often mildly critical.</span></span></p><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"https://github.com/evanclan/OpenJLPT/blob/main/data/json/grammar/n1.json\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看 OpenJLPT 来源</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">OpenJLPT の出典を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>","<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n1\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">〜んがため(に)</span><span class=\"lvb\">N1</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">为了……，常带强烈的目的或决心</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">in order to; for the sake of (strong resolve)</span></span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">动词ない形去「ない」 + んがため(に) (する → せんがため)</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Verb-nai stem + んがため(に) (する → せんがため)</span></span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>夢<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をかなえんがため、<ruby>全<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>財産<rp>(</rp><rt>ざいさん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をなげうって<ruby>留学<rp>(</rp><rt>りゅうがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">为了实现梦想，他舍弃了自己拥有的一切，出国留学。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">To realize his dream, he gave up everything he owned to study abroad.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>勝<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たんがための<ruby>卑劣<rp>(</rp><rt>ひれつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>な<ruby>手段<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅだん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、スポーツマンシップに<ruby>反<rp>(</rp><rt>はん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">为了赢就使出不正当的手段，有违体育精神。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Resorting to underhanded tactics just to win goes against sportsmanship.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>真実<rp>(</rp><rt>しんじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>明<rp>(</rp><rt>あき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らかにせんがために、<ruby>記者<rp>(</rp><rt>きしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちは<ruby>危険<rp>(</rp><rt>きけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>顧<rp>(</rp><rt>かえり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みず<ruby>取材<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅざい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>続<rp>(</rp><rt>つづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">为了揭开真相，记者们不顾危险继续采访报道。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">To bring the truth to light, the reporters kept reporting regardless of the danger.</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"note\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">补充</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">補足</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">古雅而强烈，表达坚定的决心，通常不用来谈琐碎的小目标。「〜んがための＋名词」可修饰名词。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Archaic and emphatic, expressing strong determination; not for trivial goals. 〜んがための + Noun modifies a noun.</span></span></p><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"https://github.com/evanclan/OpenJLPT/blob/main/data/json/grammar/n1.json\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看 OpenJLPT 来源</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">OpenJLPT の出典を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>","<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n1\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">〜んばかり</span><span class=\"lvb\">N1</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">几乎要……、仿佛马上就会……</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">as if about to; almost (to the point of)</span></span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">动词ない形去「ない」 + んばかり (する → せんばかり)</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Verb-nai stem + んばかり (する → せんばかり)</span></span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>優勝<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まった<ruby>瞬間<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅんかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、スタジアムは<ruby>割<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れんばかりの<ruby>拍手<rp>(</rp><rt>はくしゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>包<rp>(</rp><rt>つつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">冠军一决出，体育场里顿时响起震耳欲聋的掌声。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">The moment the championship was decided, the stadium was filled with deafening applause.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にも<ruby>泣<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんばかりの<ruby>顔<rp>(</rp><rt>かお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で、<ruby>事情<rp>(</rp><rt>じじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>説明<rp>(</rp><rt>せつめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">她一副随时都会哭出来的样子，讲述了事情的经过。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Looking as though she might burst into tears at any moment, she explained what had happened.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>課長<rp>(</rp><rt>かちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は「<ruby>君<rp>(</rp><rt>きみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のせいだ」と<ruby>言<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わんばかりに、<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をにらみつけた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">科长瞪着我，仿佛在说：“都是你的错。”</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">The section chief glared at me as if to say, &#x27;This is your fault.&#x27;</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"note\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">补充</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">補足</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">程度高得仿佛马上会发生某事。可说「〜んばかりに／〜んばかりだ／〜んばかりの＋名词」。「言わんばかり」的意思接近「〜とばかりに」。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">A state so extreme something seems about to happen, though it doesn&#x27;t. Forms: 〜んばかりに, 〜んばかりだ, 〜んばかりの + Noun. 言わんばかり overlaps with 〜とばかりに.</span></span></p><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"https://github.com/evanclan/OpenJLPT/blob/main/data/json/grammar/n1.json\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看 OpenJLPT 来源</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">OpenJLPT の出典を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>"]